//! kat_vectors — official NIST known-answer-test vectors for
//! SLH-DSA-SHA2-128f (FIPS 205), as lowercase hex strings (decoded at test
//! runtime by kat_test.zig).
//!
//! Source: NIST ACVP demo vectors, github.com/usnistgov/ACVP-Server,
//! `gen-val/json-files/SLH-DSA-keyGen-FIPS205/internalProjection.json` and
//! `gen-val/json-files/SLH-DSA-sigGen-FIPS205/internalProjection.json`
//! (retrieved 2026-07-11). Hex copied verbatim (lowercased) from the JSON.
//! Test cases, all parameterSet "SLH-DSA-SHA2-128f":
//!   - keyGen tcId 21 — seeds -> expected pk + sk (byte-exact)
//!   - sigGen tcId 115 (tgId 13: internal interface, deterministic)
//!   - sigGen tcId 2   (tgId 1:  external interface, pure, deterministic,
//!                      110-byte context)
//!   - sigGen tcId 433 (tgId 49: internal interface, hedged — explicit
//!                      additionalRandomness)

